/**
 * Staff-side live-chat SERVER ACTIONS. After the 2026-10 overhaul almost all
 * live-chat traffic (list, history, send, assign, close, snooze, typing, read)
 * goes through plain fetch routes under app/api/admin/chat/** instead —
