 * panel (or, `embedded`, fills the Support page's Live Chat tab).
 *
 * LIVE (2026-10 overhaul): while open it holds ONE EventSource on
 * /api/chat/stream for the active conversation — staff replies, typing, read
 * receipts and the AI's progress arrive the moment they happen (the old widget
 * polled every 4 s). On every (re)connect it backfills from the DB
 * (`?after=<last id>`), and if the stream can't be held at all it falls back
